     "<div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">All,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I have hourly pollutant data (ozone, NOy and  Co – see attached) from one of our ambient air monitoring sites. I would like to create a boxplot that displays all the hourly data (for one pollutant) in 12 bins (one bin per month).  I found\r\n this example below on the web.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks for your help<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img width=\"304\" height=\"303\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/4efebdb2813c03f4/image003.jpg?part=0.1\"><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i>Jean-Paul Huys<u></u><u></u></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i>Air Quality Specialist | ph <a href=\"tel:(702)%20455-1684\" value=\"+17024551684\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">702.455.1684</a><u></u><u></u></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:blue\">hu...@ClarkCountyNV.gov</span></a><u></u><u></u></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i>Clark County Dept of Air Quality<u></u><u></u></i></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i>4701 W Russell Rd, Suite 200, Las Vegas, NV 89118<span><font color=\"#888888\"><u></u><u></u></font></span></i></p><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</font></span></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n</font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
